# =========================================================
# Root-level convenience file
# =========================================================
# This project uses two separate, service-scoped environment files:
#
#   backend/.env.example   -> copy to backend/.env
#   frontend/.env.example  -> copy to frontend/.env
#
# Configure each service independently — see those files for the
# full list of available variables (model weights path, CORS origins,
# storage paths, API base URL, etc).
